{"id":1,"name":"S5 Road South","x":5,"y":14,"note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"characterIndex":0,"characterName":"","direction":2,"pattern":0,"tileId":0},"list":[{"code":356,"indent":0,"parameters":["MSGSE TALK 1"]},{"code":241,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"Field2","volume":80,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[15,15,0]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":123,"indent":0,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(The road back from El Polvorin is a river of fleeing men. What was an army hours ago is now a broken column strung out along dirt paths, through cogon grass, across rice paddies still wet from the afternoon rain. In the distance, church bells ring in San Juan del Monte — in alarm, not celebration.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Florante> (shouting) Don't look back! Keep going!"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(They pass a wounded Katipunero slumped against a tree. He laughs — a hollow, broken sound.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Wounded Katipunero> We lost... We lost. It's over. It's over."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(Florante stops. He crouches in front of him.)"]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[30]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Florante> Don't speak that way. You are still alive. While you are alive — there is still a fight."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(The wounded man looks at him. Florante helps him to his feet. They move on together — three instead of two.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(The three reach a crossroads. The wounded man points east toward Mariquina — where Bonifacio retreated. Florante looks at the southern road.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Florante> If we go with him, we go back to where we just fled. The Spanish will pursue Bonifacio — they know he is the leader."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Florante> We would be more useful alive and fighting elsewhere."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(The wounded man understands. He clasps Florante's arm — the Katipunan salute — and limps east.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Wounded Katipunero> Be careful. You will hear many stories on the road — not all of them are true. Choose carefully what you believe."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(Florante turns south. You follow.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["girl",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Sandra> (internal) South. Toward Cavite."]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"Decision2","volume":75,"pitch":60,"pan":0}]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[20]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[15,15,0]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[30]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["(Days pass on the back roads of Laguna. Two travelers, moving south through green country under a wide sky.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Florante> We are carrying the story of San Juan with us. Everywhere we go, people will need to hear it."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["girl",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\n<Sandra> (internal) I have never walked this far in my life. But there is no going back now."]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[20]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[16,1,0]},{"code":123,"indent":0,"parameters":["A",true]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":3,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":true,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"characterIndex":0,"characterName":"","direction":2,"pattern":0,"tileId":0},"list":[{"code":205,"indent":0,"parameters":[-1,{"list":[{"code":29,"parameters":[2],"indent":null},{"code":16,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":3,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":1,"indent":null},{"code":0}],"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"wait":true}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":29,"parameters":[2],"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":16,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":1,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"code":3,"indent":null}]},{"code":505,